{"summary":"担尖是古代医疗工具，用于刺破肠痈排脓。性味不详，烧灰酒服可治肠痈，使脓血排出而愈。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"释名：出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"肠痈已成，取少许烧灰，酒服，当作孔出脓血愈（思邈）。","translation":"主治：肠痈已经形成，取少量担尖烧成灰，用酒送服，应当会形成孔洞排出脓血而痊愈。（孙思邈）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#擔尖","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}